---
// Why Me Section — 3 Differentiators
---

<section class="section whyme" id="whyme">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-label">为什么选我</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">懂业务、懂 AI、能落地</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        不是纯技术 geek，也不是只会卖课的博主。<br />
        是真正从一线业务里长出来的 AI 落地执行者。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="whyme-grid">
      <!-- Card 1: 懂业务 -->
      <div class="whyme-card card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="icon-box whyme-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="whyme-card-title">懂业务</h3>
        <p class="whyme-card-desc">
          4 年家居获客操盘，服务过欧派等品牌，管理过数百万级广告预算。从 3 人团队带到 40+ 人，年销 5000 万。我知道企业要的不是 AI 技术，是业绩增长。
        </p>
        <div class="whyme-card-data">
          <div class="whyme-data-item">
            <span class="whyme-data-value counter" data-target="5000" data-suffix="万">5000万</span>
            <span class="whyme-data-label">年销售额</span>
          </div>
          <div class="whyme-data-item">
            <span class="whyme-data-value counter" data-target="40" data-suffix="+人">40+人</span>
            <span class="whyme-data-label">团队规模</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: 懂 AI -->
      <div class="whyme-card card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="icon-box whyme-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 2a4 4 0 0 1 4 4c0 1.95-1.4 3.58-3.25 3.93"/>
            <path d="M8 6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="14" r="4"/>
            <path d="M12 18v4"/>
            <path d="M8 22h8"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="whyme-card-title">懂 AI</h3>
        <p class="whyme-card-desc">
          Google Gemini 认证 × 3、UNESCO OER 证书、阿里云 AI 训练师（高级）。30+ 工具深度实操，自建 OrbitOS 多 AI 协作知识管理系统。
        </p>
        <div class="whyme-card-data">
          <div class="whyme-data-item">
            <span class="whyme-data-value counter" data-target="7" data-suffix="项">7项</span>
            <span class="whyme-data-label">权威认证</span>
          </div>
          <div class="whyme-data-item">
            <span class="whyme-data-value counter" data-target="30" data-suffix="+">30+</span>
            <span class="whyme-data-label">AI 工具实操</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: 能落地 -->
      <div class="whyme-card card reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="icon-box whyme-icon">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 2v20M2 12h20"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="whyme-card-title">能落地</h3>
        <p class="whyme-card-desc">
          3 套标准化 AI 交付方案已上线，微信小程序 0 编程独立完成并上线，YouTube Shorts 半个月 500 万+播放。说得出，做得到，拿得出结果。
        </p>
        <div class="whyme-card-data">
          <div class="whyme-data-item">
            <span class="whyme-data-value counter" data-target="3" data-suffix="套">3套</span>
            <span class="whyme-data-label">交付方案</span>
          </div>
          <div class="whyme-data-item">
            <span class="whyme-data-value counter" data-target="500" data-suffix="万+">500万+</span>
            <span class="whyme-data-label">YouTube 播放</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .whyme {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .whyme-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .whyme-card {
    padding: 40px 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .whyme-icon {
    /* Base styles from .icon-box in global.css */
  }

  .whyme-card-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .whyme-card-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .whyme-card-data {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .whyme-data-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .whyme-data-value {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .whyme-data-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .whyme-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .whyme-card {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
